flowchart LR
  A[Git push] --> B[Checkout]
  B --> C[Install deps]
  C --> D[pytest + JUnit]
  D --> E{RUN_SONAR?}
  E -->|yes| F[SonarQube analysis]
  E -->|no| G
  F --> G[Trivy fs scan]
  G --> H[Docker build]
  H --> I[Trivy image scan]
  I --> K{DEPLOY_HOST set?}
  K -->|yes| L[Ship image over SSH and run on app EC2]
  L --> M[Smoke test /healthz]
  K -->|no| N[Skip deploy]
  M --> O[Archive reports]
  N --> O
